@baseUrl = http://localhost:3001/api
@documentId = replace-with-runtime-document-id

### Create RECEIVING document
### Expected: stage STORED
POST {{baseUrl}}/runtime/RECEIVING
x-tenant-id: demo
x-domain-code: DEFAULT
x-application-code: WAREHOUSE
x-user-id: admin
x-permissions: RECEIVING.CREATE,RECEIVING.READ,RECEIVING.UPDATE,RECEIVING.RECEIVE
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "data": {
    "itemName": "Bearing",
    "quantity": 10
  }
}

### Receive document and preview metadata-driven ledger impact
### Expected: stage IMPACT_READY with CREATE_DOCUMENT STOCK_MOVEMENT READY
POST {{baseUrl}}/runtime/RECEIVING/{{documentId}}/actions/RECEIVE
x-tenant-id: demo
x-domain-code: DEFAULT
x-application-code: WAREHOUSE
x-user-id: admin
x-permissions: RECEIVING.RECEIVE
Content-Type: application/json

{}
